scene__
  @name "ACT3: Spiders and Coins"
  @first "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
  @sections "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow" "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn" "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain" "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain" "The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast" "The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell" "Winterfell Night Council before witnesses" "The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners" "Harrenhal Torchlit Census at the rookery" "Dragonstone Blood Price at first light" "Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals" "The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries" "The Eyrie Crown Ultimatum by candle smoke" "Pentos Harbor Ambush in river fog" "Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood" "The Wall War Map against old law" "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky" "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse" "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors" "Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower" "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow" "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn" "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain" "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
__scene

section__
  @title "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-arc-varys-littlefinger/frame-217.jpg"

  "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow throws you into a political economy built on blackmail, debts, and selective truth. Candle wax pools on cipher tables while perfume, ink, and cellar damp mingle in the hidden rooms below court. Whisperers, brokers, and compromised clerks wait for your signal, each loyal only while the compensation and protection hold. Supply shocks and trust fractures from Act Two have become exploitable markets, and every rival house is shopping.

Every instruction here creates both leverage and exposure, and your enemies are waiting to buy whichever one you leave unattended. This chapter is blackmail economics in motion: open process protects legitimacy but leaks intent, while covert action captures initiative and compounds strategic debt that will mature at the worst possible time.

By the time this order leaves your hand, the math is already running: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. You can hide fingerprints, not consequences."

  choice__
    @target "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "File sworn testimony in open session, spend tactical flexibility, and secure lawful cover for the next operation."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Route pressure through cutouts and paid informers, spend secrecy and moral capital, and break opposition before sunrise."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 9)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth - 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 2, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Hire offshore carriers and mercenary intermediaries, pay in treasury now, and import pressure from outside the local deadlock."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-arc-varys-littlefinger/frame-218.jpg"

  "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn throws you into a contest between two masters who treat secrets like coin. In the quiet before dawn, you hear quills, coin clink, and the scrape of knives used to open sealed raven tubes. Varys offers reach through patience, Littlefinger offers momentum through debt, and both expect you to fund the risks they keep off their own names. The public promises that stabilized earlier fronts now require hidden enforcement, forged narratives, and costly silence.

If you starve the spy network, you fight blind; if you indulge it, you normalize methods that can be turned against you in endgame politics. Every instruction here creates both leverage and exposure, and your enemies are waiting to buy whichever one you leave unattended.

Your political balance sheet will still be judged by hard values: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. In this arc, victory and compromise are often the same document with different signatures."

  choice__
    @target "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Issue terms in open court, spend reputation for legal clarity, and bind commanders to enforceable quotas before witnesses."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 7)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Use deniable arrests and forged correspondence, buy short-term control with long-term distrust, and isolate rival captains quietly."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-arc-varys-littlefinger/frame-219.jpg"

  "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain throws you into an arc defined by deniable operations and private leverage. Spiced wine and lamp smoke drift through the counting room where couriers arrive with ledgers wrapped in oilcloth. Every asset claims they can deliver deniable success; none volunteer to absorb failure when the operation surfaces. Act Two taught the realm to survive on emergency bargains, and this arc turns those bargains into permanent instruments of control.

A legal move may lose the race; a deniable move may win the race and poison the finish line. If you starve the spy network, you fight blind; if you indulge it, you normalize methods that can be turned against you in endgame politics.

