section__
  @title "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-arc-varys-littlefinger/frame-220.jpg"

  "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain throws you into a shadow market where information is bought, laundered, and weaponized. Rain taps slate roofs above your safehouse as scribes dry coded letters over braziers and burn the drafts. Bankers ask for collateral, spies ask for absolution, and no one in the room mistakes either request for honesty. What looked like temporary secrecy last act now decides who controls capital flows, rumors, and succession claims.

This chapter is blackmail economics in motion: open process protects legitimacy but leaks intent, while covert action captures initiative and compounds strategic debt that will mature at the worst possible time. A legal move may lose the race; a deniable move may win the race and poison the finish line.

Your political balance sheet will still be judged by hard values: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. In this arc, victory and compromise are often the same document with different signatures."

  choice__
    @target "The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Call witnesses and fix duties in writing, paying in flexibility now to secure accountable control later."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Trade favors in private ledgers, coerce the weakest link first, and convert hidden fear into immediate leverage."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 7)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth - 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 2, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Route the operation through Braavosi credit and offshore cutouts, spend wealth and autonomy, and gain deniable reach overnight."
